{
  "title": "订单接口返回增加 status 字段",
  "source": {
    "role": "frontend",
    "repo": "org/web",
    "commit_sha": "0000000000000000000000000000000000000000"
  },
  "target": {
    "role": "backend",
    "repo": "org/api",
    "base_ref": "dev"
  },
  "requirement": "GET /api/orders 的响应 body 增加 status 字段。\n\n- 类型：string\n- 取值：OPEN | PAID | CANCELLED\n- 历史订单按 created_at 与 paid_at 推导，不回填数据库\n- 分页接口与单条接口必须一致\n- 未支付且已取消的订单返回 CANCELLED\n\n边界：status 缺失时前端按 OPEN 处理，但后端不得返回 null。",
  "scope_profile": "application",
  "scope": {
    "out_of_scope": [
      "不改鉴权与租户隔离",
      "不改订单金额与优惠计算",
      "不新增数据库列（先按现有字段推导）"
    ]
  },
  "acceptance": {
    "environment": "dev",
    "checks": [
      {
        "id": "version",
        "type": "http",
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{base_url}/version",
        "expect_status": 200,
        "expect_jsonpath": [
          { "path": "$.sha", "matches": "^[0-9a-f]{40}$" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "orders-status",
        "type": "http",
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{base_url}/api/orders?page=1",
        "headers": { "Accept": "application/json" },
        "expect_status": 200,
        "expect_jsonpath": [
          { "path": "$.items[0].status", "matches": "^(OPEN|PAID|CANCELLED)$" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "contract",
        "type": "openapi_diff",
        "expected_path": "contracts/<id>/openapi.yaml",
        "actual_url": "{base_url}/docs/openapi.json?apikey={env:DOCS_API_KEY}",
        "allow_additions": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "migration": {
    "required": false,
    "backward_compatible": true,
    "plan": "",
    "rollback": "",
    "manual_approval_required": false,
    "order": "manual"
  }
}
